})();", "README.md": "# ORBIT - Gravity Puzzle Game\n\nA gravity-rotating puzzle game where you guide a ball to the exit by rotating the entire level.\n\n## How to Play\n\n- **Objective**: Rotate the world to guide the ball into the glowing green exit zone\n- **Controls**: \n  - Arrow keys or A/D to rotate the level\n  - R to reset the current level\n  - Touch swipe on canvas (mobile)\n  - On-screen buttons (mobile)\n\n## Features\n\n- 5 unique puzzle levels\n- Time tracking with high score persistence\n- Move counter\n- Smooth rotation animations\n- Web Audio sound effects\n- Responsive design for mobile devices\n- Retro sci-fi aesthetic with neon visuals\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` - Main game page\n- `js/levels.js` - Level definitions\n- `js/physics.js` - Ball physics and collision detection\n- `js/renderer.js` - Canvas rendering with visual effects\n- `js/audio.js` - Web Audio sound manager\n- `js/game.js` - Game logic and state management\n\n## Run\n\nSimply open `index.html` in a web browser. No server required."}